[4.320825, "o", "ified`, buttons update.\\n32\\t\\n33\\t### Priority 3 — Algorithm Comparison Scenarios\\n34\\t\\n35\\t11. **Diagonal Toggle** — A* Manhattan diagonal on vs off. Verify path length difference.\\n36\\t\\n37\\t12. **Don't Cross Corners** — diagonal passage, `dontCrossCorners` on vs off. Verify corner-cutting behavior.\\n38\\t\\n39\\t13. **Bi-directional Toggle** — A* uni vs bi. Verify ~half node expansion.\\n40\\t\\n41\\t14. **IDA* Time Limit** — complex maze, 1s limit. Verify search terminates, UI handles gracefully.\\n42\\t\\n43\\t15. **JPS vs A* Node Expansion** — large open grid. Verify JPS expands far fewer nodes.\\n44\\t\\n45\\t16. **Weighted A*** — weight=1 vs weight=5. Verify fewer operations with higher weight.\\n46\\t\\n47\\t17. **Orthogonal JPS vs BFS** — obstacles, no diagonal. Verify same path length, fewer JPS nodes.\\n48\\t\\n49\\t### Priority 4 — Missing UI Features (Document Only)\\n50\\t\\n51\\t18. **Missing JPS diagonal modes** — `Always` and `OnlyWhenNoObstacles` not in UI. Document that `JumpPointFinder` factor"]
