[211.446425, "o", "finished` states. No drag possible during `searching`/`paused`.\\n\\n4. **Pause/resume is clean.** `loop()` checks `Controller.is('searching')` — pausing stops the loop, resume re-enters it from same operations array position.\\n\\n5. **No \\\"path not found\\\" UI feedback.** `view.js:drawPath` returns silently on empty path. `showStats` shows `length: 0` but no explicit message. This is a UI gap, not a library bug.\\n\\n## Full Suite Result\\n\\n```\\n256 passing (1s)\\n0 failing\\n```\\n\\nNo regressions introduced.\\n\",\"userModified\":false}}\r\n"]
